# Ground item spawns of mapsquare (45,54).
# Witch's House: the boy's ball in the shed, and the diary and the door key
# upstairs, are 289's spawns (m45_54.jm2). The 2011 wiki has each where 289
# does: the ball in the shed (Witch's House, 2011-05-20), the diary "upstairs
# in the witch's house" (Diary (Witch's House), 2011-04-25) and "a spawn of the
# key on the second floor of Nora T. Hagg's house" (Door key, 2011-05-20). It
# names no tile, so the tiles are 289's: cache 786's map still has the shed's
# crate under the ball and drawers under the diary.
0 55 4: ball 1
1 20 17: witches_diary 1
1 21 12: witches_doorkey 1
